<p>watan me qaafela-e- karbala ki aamad hai<br />
sawaariye haram-e- mustafa ki aamad hai<br />
yateem sarwar-e- gulgu'n qabaa ki aamad hai<br />
ghareeb-o- bekas-o- aasna ki aamad hai</p>

<p>tamaam shehr hai shayeq ali ke pyaarou ka<br />
nabi ke rouze pa majma hai dost daaro'n ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sunaa tha jab se ke aate hai syed-e- akram<br />
qushi se fatima sughra ka tha ajab aalam<br />
kabhi to jhukti thi sajde me wo badeeda-e- nam<br />
kabhi ye kehti thi kyu naani jaan ji gaye ham</p>

<p>watan me aaj shah-e- mashraqain aate hai<br />
chalo chalo mere baba hussain aate hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>uthi ye sunte hi ummul banee'n ba shouqe tamaam<br />
gayi jo muttasil-e- rouza-e- rasool-e- anaam<br />
suna ye shor ke lo aaye shaah-e- arsh maqaam<br />
nazar wo aata hai dekho nishaaan -e- fouj-e- imaam</p>

<p>bade shikwe se hyder ka yaadgaar aaya<br />
alam liye huwe abbas-e- naamdaar aaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye nouha padhta tha ghode ke aage aage basheer<br />
madina lut gaya jangal me margaye shabbir<br />
gale pa dilbar-e- zehra ke chal gayi shamsheer<br />
kiya shaheed ghareebul watan ko be taqseer</p>

<p>pada raha jo zamee'n par ye uska jaama hai<br />
kafan mila na jise uska ye amaama hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bitha ke naaqe ko sajjad-e- naatawaa'n utre<br />
asaa ko thaam ke baa chasm qoo fishaa'n utre<br />
qareeb-e- marqad-e- sultaane ins-o- jaa'n utre<br />
aur ahle bait ye karte huwe fughaa'n utre</p>

<p>huwi ghareebo'n pe bedaad ya rasool allah<br />
hussain margaye faryaad ya rasool allah<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>huwa jo rouze me daaqil wo qaafela naagaah<br />
gire mazaar-e mubaarak pe abid-e- zeejaah<br />
uthaa ke haath ye faryaad ki ba naala-o- aah<br />
tabaahi aagayi ham bekaso'n pe yaa jaddaah</p>

<p>yateem hoke ye naashaad kaam aaya hai<br />
pidar ko khoke watan me ghulaam aaya hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bada sitam kiya ummat ne ya rasool -e- zaman<br />
kiya huzoor ke pyaaro'n ko zibha tishna dahan<br />
raha sinaa pe sar-e- paak aur zamee'n pe badan<br />
lute ham aise ke baba ko de sake na kafan</p>

<p>na din ko thi hame raahat na chain raato ko<br />
jakad diya tha rasan se hamaare haatho'n ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>gayi lahad pa phir is tarha zainab-e- meh'zu<br />
ke ek haath me sheh ka amaama-e- pur qu<br />
aur ek haath me hazrat ka jaama-e- gul gu<br />
zabaa'n pe marsia jis ka ye jaa'n gaza mazmu'n</p>

<p>yazeed ne hame loota duhaayi hai nana<br />
behan shaheed ke mujre ko aayi hai nana<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hussain bhaai ko ham karbala me chod aaye<br />
ali ke laal ko dasht-e- bala me chod aaye<br />
yateem-e fatima ko nainawa me chod aaye<br />
tumhaare chand ko qaak-e- shifa me chod aaye</p>

<p>ye baad qatl ajab tafreqaa pada nana<br />
gada badan kahi'n aur sar kahi'n gada nana<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>huwi hussain ke marne se dar badar zainab<br />
gayi yazeed ki majlis me nange sar zainab<br />
kayi mahine rahi qaid nouhagar zainab<br />
ye saqt jaa'n thi ke jeeti phiri idhar zainab</p>

<p>waram hai shaano'n pe dukhthe hai ustoqaa'n nana<br />
ye mere baazu pa rassi ke hai nashaa'n nana<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>